<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army has seized Bakori and Sali in West Kordofan and recaptured Al-Khuwai and other areas in West and North Kordofan from the RSF, while the RSF continues drone strikes that killed nine civilians in the Blue Nile. The army shot down an RSF drone that crossed from Ethiopia, adding to reports of drones being launched across the border. Gold smuggled from Sudan is being routed through Ethiopia to the UAE, which remains the main destination for the illicit metal. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOWXVTdmpMaE8xQjVDejhla3FQS3JuR1NjaW1TeGswMGlvVkpwNFRMVTliLWV6TG9zWk1DN1Z0b2NSQUpwYkNfMEJ4dW9jdWJWX0JvbVp6VFI0eHZWYjNDZEJvaXZ0UURXN3lUV216aWJBeHJIelh0WEhEam9QM2cwdXB0c3BzRVhNdVR3dkxMWTMtalR3amVUNE5UMk9mbTA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE9Sb255ek9CX0dfdjdIWUNqWDNzbUFKYWVjV1BQcDhXYXRkMV9kcjlaRG9EMGx1bWtBS1M4RmJCNW00N0d3MmJNa19DTm51S3c3cmZsLUVMcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTFBhbmIxVDFQSkhMWlVKUkU1RW82RS1VNFRrTy1pR0N3cFIyR3JqY0RHNlEwQUhpWktzSXNqZEp6THFLWmVzYk1VcGxQR1ZGVk5vTmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Addis Standard&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE1kSFU5R3puTTZnRktfVnYtOXZfYkVQRzJnWWgxTVQ4OUJqS1V5dXl0S1prdmppSTBnY3VGSFJwM0FLSTRlYW1HZ0liYjFFalRNdkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Addis Standard&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxOdGZoblpzNEd0ekhpTDVJekpmT3RHWmF0QWFsSk05a1ZEWHk3RWVKX1Z6a3lOTFVCOWIwcHMydWlfQzJXRzlUbHNvZUJNT04wME1CbkQ4TWVkNmVUT3RDVDJmd1E2ZmE4QVpRcXI2RGUzSXJSbXhqZmRIbEI5NGk4bTF2YVhsc1lyNjBlZkNEakNnMkJPYmRLQ1p5d29BYmF3MWRGak1sRXdGLXZjeFNqQ3RRUG82UmFaME53bFBSZjNEUC1ZNTViNlRJTlJmUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsCord&lt